12. Describe the measures taken by the entity to ensure a safe and healthy workplace:
The Company has implemented a comprehensive HSW framework to ensure safe and healthy working conditions across operations. Key measures include:
(i) Mandatory safety induction and role-based HSW training programmes for employees and field personnel;
(ii) Bi-annual HSW Deep Dive Audits across all managed premises;
